{"page":572,"verses":[{"verse_key":"72:1","surah":72,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" قُلْ أُوحِىَ إِلَىَّ أَنَّهُ ٱسْتَمَعَ نَفَرٌ مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ فَقَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا سَمِعْنَا قُرْءَانًا عَجَبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘It has been revealed to me that a group of jinn once listened in and said, “We have heard a wondrous Quran,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أُوحِىَ","en_gloss":"It has been revealed","transliteration":"ūḥiya","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَىَّ","en_gloss":"to me","transliteration":"ilayya","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنَّهُ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"annahu","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","en_gloss":"listened","transliteration":"is'tamaʿa","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَفَرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a group","transliteration":"nafarun","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْجِنِّ","en_gloss":"the jinn","transliteration":"l-jini","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَقَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and they said","transliteration":"faqālū","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَمِعْنَا","en_gloss":"heard","transliteration":"samiʿ'nā","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قُرْءَانًا","en_gloss":"a Quran","transliteration":"qur'ānan","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَجَبًۭا","en_gloss":"amazing","transliteration":"ʿajaban","verse_key":"72:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"72:1"}]},{"verse_key":"72:2","surah":72,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"يَهْدِىٓ إِلَى ٱلرُّشْدِ فَـَٔامَنَّا بِهِۦ ۖ وَلَن نُّشْرِكَ بِرَبِّنَآ أَحَدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"that gives guidance to the right path, and we have come to believe it––We shall never set up partners with our Lord––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَهْدِىٓ","en_gloss":"It guides","transliterat